# PROJECT OVERVIEW
This is a web application built with Next.js 15 that serves as a entrypoint for web3 community and community tech.


# TECH STACK
The project uses the following core technologies:
Frontend:
- Next.js 14 (React framework with App Router created with T3 create app)
- TypeScript
- Shadcn component framework based on Tailwind styling and Radix UI headless UI
- Lucide Icons
- React Query for data fetching/caching

Backend: 
- Nextjs server actions powered by tRPC transport
- Local postgres for development need
- Planetscale for production
- Drizzle Kit for ORM and database difference abstraction 


